sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant P as Partner backend
    participant API as Django external API + service layer
    participant DB as Postgres
    participant R as Rater Lambda (pinned version)

    Note over P,API: every call passes through API Gateway (Cognito token, usage plan, access log)
    P->>API: GET /v1/programs/{id}/application-schema
    API-->>P: JSON Schema for the program version in effect (cacheable, immutable)

    P->>API: POST /v1/applications (Idempotency-Key, external_ref)
    API->>DB: tx: application (program_version + its rater pinned), preset answers (source=preset), idempotency row
    API-->>P: 201 draft + requirements[] (what is still missing)

    loop as the user answers
        P->>API: PATCH /v1/applications/{id} answers (If-Match)
        API->>API: per answer: key in this version? right type? allowed value?
        alt invalid
            API-->>P: 422 problem+json, every bad field by JSON Pointer
        else valid
            API->>DB: upsert answers (one row per question)
            API-->>P: 200 + updated requirements[]
        end
    end

    P->>API: POST /v1/applications/{id}/submit (no body, If-Match, Idempotency-Key)
    API->>API: completeness check (all required visible questions answered)
    API->>DB: status = submitted
    API->>API: build payload: declared inputs only + coverages + discounts + combined config
    API->>API: preflight: payload valid against the rater manifest?
    alt preflight fails (an earlier check has a bug)
        API->>DB: rating_run(outcome=input_error), quote = needs_attention
        Note over API: alarm pages on-call, no premium written
    else ok
        API->>R: invoke(payload)
        R-->>API: premiums per coverage, or structured error
        API->>DB: tx: rating_run(request, response) + application_coverage premiums
    end
    API-->>P: 202 {status}
    P->>API: GET /v1/applications/{id}/quote
    API-->>P: quoted / declined / referred / pending, premium per coverage
